Power BI Dashboard Insights

Project: Customer Churn Analysis

* Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
- Total Customers: 1000
- Churned Customers: 270
- Retained Customers: 730
- Churn Rate: 27%


* Key Findings
- 270 customers have left the company.
- 730 customers are still with the company.
- Overall churn rate is 27%.
- Month-to-month contracts have the highest churn count (211).

 *Business Recommendations
- Improve customer retention.
- Offer special discounts to month-to-month customers.
- Understand why customers are leaving.
- Encourage customers to choose long-term contracts.

* Conclusion
This dashboard helps businesses understand customer churn and improve customer retention.
